SUMMARY:ICIP 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Conference on Image Processing\nStatus: conf
 irmed\, checked 2026-11-14\nOfficial source: https://2027.ieeeicip.org/\n
 Venue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#icip-2027\nNotes: The
  official ICIP 2027 site (checked 2026-11-14) confirms Singapore\, Nov 29
 -Dec 3\, 2027. Its CFP gives Mar 31 for regular/special-session papers (5
  pages + 1 reference page\, IEEE Xplore) and for OJ-SP papers (8 pages + 
 1 reference page\; the date table says 9 pages\; published in the journal
  instead of the proceedings). Decisions follow on Aug 6\, final papers on
  Aug 11 and satellite-workshop papers on Aug 11. The CFP gives days only\
 , with no hour\, timezone or portal opening\; 23:59 AoE is an ordering pr
 oxy and ICS uses all-day events. One-page Work-in-Progress abstracts\, jo
 urnal-presentation requests (Aug 11) and Grand Challenge papers (Aug 11) 
 are not modelled as new-paper routes\; the WIP abstract deadline is not l
 isted in the date table. Size XL is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Signal Processing,Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition,Machine 
 Learning,Deep Representation Learning
URL:https://2027.ieeeicip.org/
